# Brief 156: the SystemVerilog twin's FORMAL assertions, proved with SymbiYosys (Yosys's own front end, -formal -DFORMAL)
[tasks]
bmc
prove
cover

[options]
bmc: mode bmc
prove: mode prove
prove: depth 8
cover: mode cover
depth 20

[engines]
smtbmc z3

[script]
read -formal -sv -DFORMAL bm_debounce.sv sync2.sv gray_stepper.sv gray_fv.sv
prep -top gray_fv

